<title>UK: First Austria Bank sets 100 mln mark 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>First Austria Bank sets 100 mln mark 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following subordinated bond was announced by lead manager Merrill Lynch.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FIRST AUSTRIA BANK</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN MARK  COUPON     6.0 PCT   MATURITY    14.MAR.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.39    PAY DATE    14.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.50	REOFFER    99.29     SPREAD	+55 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	A2	  LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.40	SELL CONC  1.6	 LIST FEE    0.50</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
